# LeakSanitizer suppressions, and ONLY for third-party code. Nothing in
# ctbrowser is suppressed here, ever - a suppression that silences your own
# code turns a green sanitizer run into a decoration.
#
# SDL's offscreen video driver initialises EGL and does not release it at
# SDL_Quit; the allocation is inside SDL_EGL_InitializeOffscreen and the driver
# it loads. Reachable only from the one test that drives run_app rather than
# the browser alone - a browser test never initialises a video driver at all.
#
# Verified by planting a leak in ctbrowser::shell and confirming it is still
# reported with these active.
leak:SDL_EGL_InitializeOffscreen
leak:libSDL3
leak:libEGL
leak:libGLX
